    "full_story_part2": {
      "status": "OK",
      "text": "Now, some companies are changing that plan. Scotiabank and iCapital Network are among the companies bringing back assigned desks in some offices. This does not mean that hot-desking has ended everywhere. The change is quiet and limited. Assigned desks are returning in some offices, while companies are also reducing their dependence on empty desks. The old personal desk is returning in some places, but the shared desk has not disappeared.",
