      "text": "Gensler data shows why the change may matter. Among workers with assigned desks, 87% said they felt they belonged at work, compared with 74% without assigned desks. Also, 80% said they could focus well, compared with 67% in hot-desking settings. Korn Ferry says changing desks and nearby coworkers can make work less predictable. These findings help explain the return in some offices.",
